Standuppp 站站鸭 (formerly 久坐工具提醒 / sitless)
Modifications copyright 2026 584144 (https://github.com/584144), same licence (GPL-3.0).

This is a modified fork of sigstop, renamed as upstream's trademark policy asks. Changes from
upstream commit 651a6d8, made in October 2026:

  - A break during which the keyboard or mouse was in use for more than
    maxActiveDuringBreakSeconds (default 60) is not honored and does not reset the
    work clock; break_end logs active_s and void.
  - Renamed: bundle id io.github.584144.standuppp, executable standuppp, modules
    StandupppCore / StandupppSensors / StandupppApp, new icon, menu bar mark and colours.
  - The upstream update feed was emptied.
  - A Chinese (zh-Hans) interface with a calm Chinese prompt set, chosen by a
    language setting that follows macOS by default.
  - Removed what only served upstream's releases and website: the update feed,
    release and appcast scripts, the badge export, and the trademark file.
  - A desktop pet whose mood follows the work clock, and the Dock icon off by default.
  - Fifteen synthesized comic sketches (sound, spoken line, sound), one at random from a
    shuffle bag on the first reminder of a break.
  - Renamed again to Standuppp (站站鸭), bundle id io.github.584144.standuppp, with a
    yellow rubber duck as icon and default desktop pet; the ghost stays as an option.
